          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nindi, Ifuku dekumi dakakweji kanukamu chitanu nachiyedi didi ifuku dakubutapa; dakekali denu dakupompa kwajila, mwakadikabishaŋa munyichima yenu; mwakalambuli himulambu wakumwilila Yehova nakesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.27"
